  "prompt": "Xét tính chẵn, lẻ của các hàm số sau:\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
